# File discipline (cloud)

Default: **edit the file that already owns the job.** Name the function you change.

Allowed: in-place edit · delete old + add replacement · merge several files into one (delete extras).

Forbidden: keep adding `.py` helpers, `*_v2.py`, parallel utils, or a new module when an existing one should absorb the change.

If you add a file, say what existing file would have held it and what you delete/consolidate so net count does not creep.

Master: `../QSWorkflow/MAP.md` when available.
